    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This paper considers some crucial elements in the development of economic thinking\r\nin France from the end of the 17th century to the Restoration period. We study four\r\nimportant authors or groups: Pierre de Boisguilbert, François Quesnay and the\r\nPhysiocrats, Anne-Robert-Jacques Turgot, the Idéologues and Jean-Baptiste Say.",
